{"rule_id":"planner.user-system-flow.flow-router-does-not-carry-flow-variables","path":"vendor/atdd-bun/conventions/planner/user-system-flow/planner.user-system-flow.flow-router-does-not-carry-flow-variables.convention.yaml","statement_start_line":6,"statement_end_line":7,"statement_verbatim":"statement: Flow routers select routes and declare payload contract identities; they\n  must not contain flow-variable runtime values or artifact data.","terms_header_line":8,"exception_header_line":null,"source_line_count":29,"source_blob_sha":"b81a170070e758888786f5e9cb9a44c9de3961e0"}
{"rule_id":"planner.user-system-flow.flow-router-entrypoint-shape","path":"vendor/atdd-bun/conventions/planner/user-system-flow/planner.user-system-flow.flow-router-entrypoint-shape.convention.yaml","statement_start_line":6,"statement_end_line":7,"statement_verbatim":"statement: Every flow router declares whether it is runtime-exposed and which Station\n  Master actions are expected to reach it.","terms_header_line":8,"exception_header_line":null,"source_line_count":31,"source_blob_sha":"720989a62d713f6f14b1ecaeb27862579fb9331c"}
{"rule_id":"planner.user-system-flow.flow-router-fragment-acceptance-binding","path":"vendor/atdd-bun/conventions/planner/user-system-flow/planner.user-system-flow.flow-router-fragment-acceptance-binding.convention.yaml","statement_start_line":6,"statement_end_line":7,"statement_verbatim":"statement: Every guarded alt/opt fragment binds to acceptance(s), and flow-branch\n  acceptances bind back to guards/fragments.","terms_header_line":8,"exception_header_line":null,"source_line_count":31,"source_blob_sha":"c13f713bb9be7339b42642b8ce9ffb06db7a13a3"}
{"rule_id":"planner.user-system-flow.flow-router-guard-coverage","path":"vendor/atdd-bun/conventions/planner/user-system-flow/planner.user-system-flow.flow-router-guard-coverage.convention.yaml","statement_start_line":6,"statement_end_line":7,"statement_verbatim":"statement: Every executable guard path in a flow router maps to exactly one user/system flow\n  route, unless explicitly classified as structural residual.","terms_header_line":8,"exception_header_line":null,"source_line_count":30,"source_blob_sha":"f6b72c237032b25ff64b7180c31901bbcd7c837b"}
{"rule_id":"planner.user-system-flow.flow-router-guard-grammar","path":"vendor/atdd-bun/conventions/planner/user-system-flow/planner.user-system-flow.flow-router-guard-grammar.convention.yaml","statement_start_line":6,"statement_end_line":7,"statement_verbatim":"statement: Flow router guards are declarative, deterministic, side-effect-free expressions;\n  raw Python eval is forbidden.","terms_header_line":8,"exception_header_line":null,"source_line_count":32,"source_blob_sha":"bc77570647de30b41f717aa12e1abdd2ce929e5b"}
{"rule_id":"planner.user-system-flow.flow-router-home","path":"vendor/atdd-bun/conventions/planner/user-system-flow/planner.user-system-flow.flow-router-home.convention.yaml","statement_start_line":6,"statement_end_line":7,"statement_verbatim":"statement: Flow router artifacts live under plan/_user_system_flows/_flow_routers/ and are\n  registered in plan/_user_system_flows/_flow_routers.yaml.","terms_header_line":8,"exception_header_line":null,"source_line_count":30,"source_blob_sha":"b754581454bce293d7b71fcc5d34523ee5e262b5"}
{"rule_id":"planner.user-system-flow.flow-router-message-payload-typed","path":"vendor/atdd-bun/conventions/planner/user-system-flow/planner.user-system-flow.flow-router-message-payload-typed.convention.yaml","statement_start_line":6,"statement_end_line":7,"statement_verbatim":"statement: Every flow router message declares a payload contract or an explicit no-payload\n  reason.","terms_header_line":8,"exception_header_line":null,"source_line_count":29,"source_blob_sha":"beed9bbc47c084df1305d3f82afeced7cda49727"}
{"rule_id":"planner.user-system-flow.flow-router-payload-contract-body-required","path":"vendor/atdd-bun/conventions/planner/user-system-flow/planner.user-system-flow.flow-router-payload-contract-body-required.convention.yaml","statement_start_line":6,"statement_end_line":7,"statement_verbatim":"statement: A payload contract identity referenced by a flow router message must\n  resolve to a contract schema body.","terms_header_line":8,"exception_header_line":null,"source_line_count":29,"source_blob_sha":"092cb378e02ab163b682d0c9a210dcea04d907c4"}
{"rule_id":"planner.user-system-flow.flow-router-payload-contract-registered","path":"vendor/atdd-bun/conventions/planner/user-system-flow/planner.user-system-flow.flow-router-payload-contract-registered.convention.yaml","statement_start_line":6,"statement_end_line":8,"statement_verbatim":"statement: A payload contract identity referenced by a flow router message must\n  resolve to an authored/registered contract in the contracts registry, not merely\n  a file that glob-matches.","terms_header_line":9,"exception_header_line":null,"source_line_count":32,"source_blob_sha":"36b24bd4af1ff7a6f18056b90e695940b67e555f"}
{"rule_id":"planner.user-system-flow.flow-router-projection-equivalence","path":"vendor/atdd-bun/conventions/planner/user-system-flow/planner.user-system-flow.flow-router-projection-equivalence.convention.yaml","statement_start_line":6,"statement_end_line":7,"statement_verbatim":"statement: A referenced user/system flow sequence must equal the flow router route projection\n  by step, intent, from, to, and artifact.","terms_header_line":8,"exception_header_line":null,"source_line_count":33,"source_blob_sha":"1cadca893ddb02c61399039292cfda0520b9b640"}
{"rule_id":"planner.user-system-flow.flow-router-route-category-matches-user-system-flow-id","path":"vendor/atdd-bun/conventions/planner/user-system-flow/planner.user-system-flow.flow-router-route-category-matches-user-system-flow-id.convention.yaml","statement_start_line":6,"statement_end_line":8,"statement_verbatim":"statement: Every flow router route declares nominal/error/alternate/exception and\n  that category must equal the `category` field of the target user/system flow it selects\n  (issue #1421 — category is a validated field, not an identity digit).","terms_header_line":9,"exception_header_line":null,"source_line_count":33,"source_blob_sha":"8b9c7016511cb5ae3c0afb71969e71662c963b3f"}
{"rule_id":"planner.user-system-flow.flow-router-route-resolution-deterministic","path":"vendor/atdd-bun/conventions/planner/user-system-flow/planner.user-system-flow.flow-router-route-resolution-deterministic.convention.yaml","statement_start_line":6,"statement_end_line":7,"statement_verbatim":"statement: Route resolution strategy is explicit and deterministic; ambiguous matching\n  routes fail closed unless unique priority is declared.","terms_header_line":8,"exception_header_line":null,"source_line_count":31,"source_blob_sha":"0289145acc778dfc27e41ed5ac34a370ee9cc141"}
{"rule_id":"planner.user-system-flow.flow-router-structural-residual-explicit","path":"vendor/atdd-bun/conventions/planner/user-system-flow/planner.user-system-flow.flow-router-structural-residual-explicit.convention.yaml","statement_start_line":6,"statement_end_line":7,"statement_verbatim":"statement: Structural residuals must be explicit, narrow, and bound to an acceptance\n  and validator.","terms_header_line":8,"exception_header_line":null,"source_line_count":31,"source_blob_sha":"e35e18ce711ca943fac095796e29e4e06ad410f5"}
{"rule_id":"planner.user-system-flow.initial-flow-variables-inputs-declared","path":"vendor/atdd-bun/conventions/planner/user-system-flow/planner.user-system-flow.initial-flow-variables-inputs-declared.convention.yaml","statement_start_line":6,"statement_end_line":6,"statement_verbatim":"statement: A user/system flow MUST declare every artifact flow variables may be seeded with - inputs.caller (caller-provided) and inputs.spec_materialized (deterministically materialized from the spec). Undeclared or missing required initial inputs are rejected before step 1. Pending binding - validator owned by D2 (#1086).","terms_header_line":7,"exception_header_line":null,"source_line_count":11,"source_blob_sha":"01f37c0d6ae7af5c7055af712692cb450f260cb9"}
{"rule_id":"planner.user-system-flow.linearity","path":"vendor/atdd-bun/conventions/planner/user-system-flow/planner.user-system-flow.linearity.convention.yaml","statement_start_line":6,"statement_end_line":7,"statement_verbatim":"statement: 'User/system flows are strictly linear: sequences contain steps only — no loops, routes, or branching;\n  new paths MUST become new user/system flows.'","terms_header_line":26,"exception_header_line":null,"source_line_count":29,"source_blob_sha":"8c24253b19f519121e36818dcdcda6009a95caab"}
{"rule_id":"planner.user-system-flow.naming","path":"vendor/atdd-bun/conventions/planner/user-system-flow/planner.user-system-flow.naming.convention.yaml","statement_start_line":6,"statement_end_line":8,"statement_verbatim":"statement: user_system_flow_id is the typed identity user-system-flow:{subject}:{descriptive-name}, with\n  kebab-case subject and descriptive name; title is Title Case; files are flat at\n  plan/_user_system_flows/{user_system_flow_id}.yaml.","terms_header_line":20,"exception_header_line":null,"source_line_count":27,"source_blob_sha":"7eb98811d06ea42e13beb823c8d27eca2a7eb27b"}
{"rule_id":"planner.user-system-flow.participants","path":"vendor/atdd-bun/conventions/planner/user-system-flow/planner.user-system-flow.participants.convention.yaml","statement_start_line":6,"statement_end_line":7,"statement_verbatim":"statement: 'Participants are the actors in a user/system flow workflow: capability:{id}, user:{role}, or system:{source};\n  each listed once.'","terms_header_line":19,"exception_header_line":null,"source_line_count":28,"source_blob_sha":"c020238c1933f051e93f92356a95fb4e1564650e"}
{"rule_id":"planner.user-system-flow.production-implementation","path":"vendor/atdd-bun/conventions/planner/user-system-flow/planner.user-system-flow.production-implementation.convention.yaml","statement_start_line":6,"statement_end_line":7,"statement_verbatim":"statement: User/system flows are production orchestration (not test infrastructure), executed by FlowRunner under\n  python/user-system-flows/.","terms_header_line":22,"exception_header_line":null,"source_line_count":25,"source_blob_sha":"dad08d28c1c8852b207b530d4226aa4b3cf0f4b3"}
